The '''Stillgore Château''' is a location in the [[Rift Dimension]].

{{RiftGuide|Craft the Crux Chronomicon|Enigma: Standing there|Enigma: Between Towers|Enigma: Castle Fleespook|Enigma: Castle Flower Pot|Enigma: Fairylosopher|Eye: The Prince|more=1|souls=6}}
== Features ==
The '''Stillgore Château''' features many attractions. The player must have talked to {{NPCSprite|Deer}} after crossing the {{Zone|Photon Pathway}} in order to access the location.

=== Oubliette ===
{{Main|Oubliette}}
If the player loses all their {{Stat|Hearts}}, they will be transported to the {{Zone|Oubliette}}. The player can escape after killing all of the [[Oubliette Guard]]s.

=== Porhtal's Eye ===
{{Main|Porhtal}}
[[Porhtal|'''The Prince''']] is the eye in the {{zone|Stillgore Château}}.

=== Blood Effigies ===
There are {{Green|6}} Blood Effigies located in the '''Stillgore Château'''. Each Blood Effigy has {{RD|3 Block of Redstone!Blocks of Redstone|nl=y}}, which can be broken from top to bottom to grant everyone on the island {{Stat|rift damage|+2}} for {{Green|20}} minutes. The {{Item|Bedrock|link=}} on each Blood Effigy can also be clicked to reset the timer when it is granting {{Stat|rift damage}}.

